Lowest Priced Product = 
VAR MinPrice = MIN(products[Product_Price])
RETURN
    CALCULATE(
        SELECTEDVALUE(products[Product_Name], "Multiple Products"),
        FILTER(
            products,
            products[Product_Price]= MinPrice
        )
    )

Result is Name of the product with lowest cost if there is multiple products with same cost then Multiple products
